do call 114 1 62 1 0 16
narrate !The Red Ribbon Army wanted the world. Its generals put their faith in tanks, guns and numbers.
narrate !But far below their headquarters, one scientist dreamed of a soldier that could never be beaten.
do call 114 1 63 1 72 24
narrate !A soldier that never tires, never doubts and never disobeys... a perfect warrior, built by human hands.
narrate !His name was Dr. Gero.
narrate !One day, a boy called Goku would take everything from him... and Dr. Gero would swear to make him pay.
do call 114 0 2 0 0 0
narrate !This is the story of the man who built the Androids.
